WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.327
Meet Taskify

00:00:01.327 --> 00:00:05.146
a campus-focused platform that brings student opportunities

00:00:05.146 --> 00:00:06.312
buying and selling

00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:09.160
and equipment rentals together in one place.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.629
Need help with something, or have a skill you can offer?

00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:16.423
With Tasks, students can discover opportunities

00:00:16.423 --> 00:00:18.563
connect around work that needs doing

00:00:18.563 --> 00:00:21.060
and turn their time and skills into value.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.020
Looking for something you need

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.083
or have something you no longer use?

00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:38.790
Sales helps students discover items from their campus community and gives sellers a place to showcase what they have.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.831
Need equipment without buying it outright?

00:00:46.831 --> 00:00:50.809
Rentals helps students find items they can use when they need them

00:00:50.809 --> 00:00:55.570
while giving owners an opportunity to make their resources available to others.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.895
Whether you're finding help

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:05.412
discovering your next purchase, or renting what you need

00:01:05.412 --> 00:01:08.802
Taskify brings more campus opportunities within reach.

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:12.130
One platform. Three ways to make student life easier.
